# Ad-hoc screenshots dropped at the repo root during manual/Playwright verification —
# root-only (leading slash) so it doesn't affect real image assets living in subdirectories
# like src/assets/ or src-tauri/icons/.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg

